node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
# Host-side incremental-build state. If these leak into the agent-runner
# build context, the container's `tsc --build` decides everything is
# already compiled and emits nothing — dist never materialises and the
# runtime stage's COPY fails with `dist: not found`.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.next
coverage
.vscode
.idea
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
test-results
playwright-report
